R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-7dd48c3fcf3e4c9b876b3e43e0acae81:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-7dd48c3fcf3e4c9b876b3e43e0acae81:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-7dd48c3fcf3e4c9b876b3e43e0acae81:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-7dd48c3fcf3e4c9b876b3e43e0acae81:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-7dd48c3fcf3e4c9b876b3e43e0acae81:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","question_text":"抖音达人投放是什么意思？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":3,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":17,"valid_url_cards":11,"unique_url_events":10,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"63f45974463ad35f0e07c8cec06deddd15b0c5d234e0ea22ab471da2a3002ece","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 抖音达人投放（通俗解释）\n**达人投放，就是商家付费/付佣金，借助抖音达人账号来推广产品，分为2个常见含义，很多人容易混：**\n\n## 1、达人合作种草投放（星图/精选联盟达人带货）\n商家找达人（KOL/KOC），达人拍短视频/开直播推荐你的商品：\n- 结算方式：**坑位费+佣金**，或者**纯佣金**（精选联盟）\n- 内容：达人原创种草视频，挂购物车/团购链接，靠达人账号自然流量曝光\n- 还可以**再加钱投千川/DOU+**，给达人这条视频加热，放大流量，这一步叫达人素材投流\n- 目的：种草、建立信任、卖货、品牌曝光\n\n## 2、千川里的「达人定向投放」（广告定向）\n这是千川广告后台里的**人群定向功能**，不是找达人拍视频：\n投放广告时，选择对标达人，系统把广告推送给**该达人的粉丝、互动过的人群（达人相似人群）**，用来精准收割竞品/同赛道用户，属于广告人群包玩法\n\n> 简单一句话区分：\n> ✅ 找达人拍视频带货 = **达人合作投放**\n> ✅ 千川广告定向达人粉丝 = **达人相似定向投放**\n\n## 达人投放常见模式\n1. **纯佣达人**：无坑位费，卖出货才拿佣金，中小商家最常用（精选联盟）\n2. **坑位费+佣金**：头部/腰部达人，先付坑位费，成交再拿佣金\n3. **商家给达人素材，达人账号发布**：商家出片，达人账号挂车发布\n4. **达人素材+付费加热**：达人发视频后，商家用千川追加预算，放大这条视频流量\n\n## 优势\n达人内容原生，比硬广更容易获得信任；垂类中小达人粉丝精准，种草转化效果好；达人产出的优质素材还能反复拿来当广告素材。\n\n\n要不要我帮你对比达人投放和自己账号千川投流的区别？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-188b906823e14982b2149b02bba98652:1","title":"千川全域和乘方的追投达人计划正确搭建思路，什么场景下需要追投达人？怎么进行基础搭建？怎么寻找精准对标达人？一条视频给你讲清楚！#千川投放技巧 #千川代投 #千川全域投放 #千川追投 #直播电商运营","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7634124169978809001","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7634124169978809001","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-188b906823e14982b2149b02bba98652:2","title":"小店随心推帮助中心","raw_url":"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/course/7336028836495374267?lessonId=7436028846495368993&spaceId=185","normalized_url":"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/course/7336028836495374267?lessonId=7436028846495368993&spaceId=185","host":"support.oceanengine.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-188b906823e14982b2149b02bba98652:3","title":"达人投放是啥？要不要额外花钱#短视频代拍 #达人投放 #内容种草 #电商运营 #逛逛","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7676085616874868337","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/76