known","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-188b906823e14982b2149b02bba98652:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-188b906823e14982b2149b02bba98652:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-188b906823e14982b2149b02bba98652:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-188b906823e14982b2149b02bba98652:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-188b906823e14982b2149b02bba98652:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","question_text":"抖音达人投放是什么意思？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":17,"valid_url_cards":11,"unique_url_events":8,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"a11575e7f25af6853a34153ec77caec2c6a34b7ede8626448073b588ba89a9c1","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 抖音达人投放（两种常见含义）\n**一句话：商家找达人合作发布带货短视频/直播，还可以额外花钱用千川/DOU+加热达人的内容；也指千川里「达人定向」广告投放**\n\n## 1、达人合作投放（最常说的达人投放）\n商家付费/佣金，找抖音达人发种草视频或者直播带货：\n- 结算方式：一口价（坑位费）、CPS佣金（卖出才给钱）、坑位费+佣金组合\n- 内容：达人用自己账号拍视频/直播，挂商品链接，靠达人本身粉丝+自然公域流量带货\n- 进阶：**商家额外出钱，用千川/小店随心推给这条达人视频加热买流量**，放大曝光，这就是大家常说的「给达人素材投流」\n\n> 本质：借达人账号信任+内容，种草卖货；可以叠加付费广告放大流量\n\n## 2、千川广告后台「达人定向投放」（广告术语）\n在巨量千川投放广告时，选择**达人粉丝/达人相似人群**作为广告定向人群：\n- 意思：投放广告，专门去推给指定达人的粉丝，或者和该达人粉丝画像相似的用户\n- 不用达人拍视频，只是拿达人账号做人群参考，用来圈精准流量，属于广告定向玩法\n\n## 两者简单区分\n- 达人合作投放：**达人发内容**（达人账号出视频/直播），商家付达人费用，可选额外投流加热\n- 达人定向投放：**商家自己素材**，广告定向瞄准对标达人的粉丝人群，单纯广告投放\n\n## 适用场景\n新品种草、品牌曝光、快速起品；中小垂类达人性价比往往高于头部大V；本地商家可以找同城探店达人做达人投放引流到店\n\n\n你是想了解达人投放合作模式，还是千川后台达人定向怎么设置？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-434cc5964f744e2d9dd045a030ef49ba:1","title":"千川全域和乘方的追投达人计划正确搭建思路，什么场景下需要追投达人？怎么进行基础搭建？怎么寻找精准对标达人？一条视频给你讲清楚！#千川投放技巧 #千川代投 #千川全域投放 #千川追投 #直播电商运营","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7634124169978809001","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7634124169978809001","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-434cc5964f744e2d9dd045a030ef49ba:2","title":"小店随心推帮助中心","raw_url":"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/course/7336028836495374267?lessonId=7436028846495368993&spaceId=185","normalized_url":"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/course/7336028836495374267?lessonId=7436028846495368993&spaceId=185","host":"support.oceanengine.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-434cc5964f744e2d9dd045a030ef49ba:3","title":"达人投放是啥？要不要额外花钱#短视频代拍 #达人投放 #内容种草 #电商运营 #逛逛","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7676085616874868337","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7676085