d":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-280d98ab2f35401da53ab8d9d42da61a:12","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-280d98ab2f35401da53ab8d9d42da61a:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-280d98ab2f35401da53ab8d9d42da61a:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-280d98ab2f35401da53ab8d9d42da61a:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-280d98ab2f35401da53ab8d9d42da61a:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-280d98ab2f35401da53ab8d9d42da61a:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","question_text":"抖音达人投放是什么意思？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":3,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":18,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":11,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"7629a6dc90fb99fba709f61731c0f402bb2f8372a58c456811dc308910decd38","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 抖音达人投放（两种常见含义）\n## 1）广义：达人合作投放（品牌/商家找达人带货种草）\n商家付费/付佣金，找抖音达人（KOL/KOC）拍短视频、开直播推荐商品，也可以**再额外花钱用千川/DOU+加热达人这条作品**，放大曝光，就叫达人投放。\n- 结算方式：一口价（星图）、纯佣金（精选联盟）、坑位费+佣金；\n- 目的：种草、品牌曝光、带货成交；\n- 特点：用达人原生内容，比硬广告更可信。\n\n## 2）千川里的「达人投放 / 达人定向」（广告投放术语）\n在巨量千川后台的一种广告计划，分两类：\n1. **达人素材投放（达人授权投流）**：达人把账号素材授权给商家，商家在千川直接投放达人发布的挂车短视频/直播间，广告费商家出，达人拿佣金；\n2. **达人相似人群定向**：广告定向投放给**对标达人的粉丝、互动人群**，不一定要用达人视频，只是抓取这类人群来投放广告，用来收割竞品/同类达人粉丝。\n\n### 简单一句话总结\n达人投放，就是**借达人账号/达人粉丝人群做推广，包含达人内容合作 + 付费广告放大流量**。\n\n### 容易混淆的概念\n- 达人合作：达人发视频，赚坑位费/佣金（自然流量）\n- 达人投放：达人发视频，**商家再加预算千川投流加热**（付费放大）\n- 达人定向：千川广告只圈选对标达人粉丝，不一定用达人素材\n\n\n\n要不要我帮你区分：达人投放、达人相似人群、达人素材投放三者的适用场景？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-60ce935557fb4e13aff2a888fe4fe000:1","title":"千川全域和乘方的追投达人计划正确搭建思路，什么场景下需要追投达人？怎么进行基础搭建？怎么寻找精准对标达人？一条视频给你讲清楚！#千川投放技巧 #千川代投 #千川全域投放 #千川追投 #直播电商运营","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7634124169978809001","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7634124169978809001","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-60ce935557fb4e13aff2a888fe4fe000:2","title":"小店随心推帮助中心","raw_url":"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/course/7336028836495374267?lessonId=7436028846495368993&spaceId=185","normalized_url":"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/course/7336028836495374267?lessonId=7436028846495368993&spaceId=185","host":"support.oceanengine.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0025","question_id":"CQ-Q0025","citation_id":"smp-60ce935557fb4e13aff2a888fe4fe000:3","title":"达人投放是啥？要不要额外花钱#短视频代拍 #达人投放 #内容种草 #电